<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">明天晚上再见</text><text for="L2">你真是喜欢勉强别人的人</text><text for="L3">周五晚 停下纯白的 BMW</text><text for="L4">在高速公路上 两人四目相对</text><text for="L5">打开右边的窗户</text><text for="L6">便能听到近在咫尺的海浪声</text><text for="L7">你指尖的香烟</text><text for="L8">烟灰落下 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(烟灰)</span></text><text for="L9">我会告诉你接下来该怎么做</text><text for="L10">突然说出那句 我渴望你的陪伴</text><text for="L11">这就是你的策略啊</text><text for="L12">但是 请别评判我</text><text for="L13">虽然我并不讨厌你 但请别触碰我</text><text for="L14">并不精明的我 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我)</span></text><text for="L15">并不能好好应对心中的爱 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(是啊)</span></text><text for="L16">在小小的便签纸上</text><text for="L17">潦草地给你写下我的地址</text><text for="L18">深夜 当你我横渡那条桥时</text><text for="L19">斑驳的月光照耀而下</text><text for="L20">当转过下一个弯道</text><text for="L21">便会接近那座遥远的城</text><text for="L22">我拿起口红</text><text for="L23">涂抹在唇上 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(口红)</span></text><text for="L24">然后 我会给你一个亲吻</text><text for="L25">如果你对我是认真的 我会将你带离此处</text><text for="L26">渐渐无法看清你的身影 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(你)</span></text><text for="L27">但请别指责我</text><text for="L28">就让你我在此离别 别再思念我</text><text for="L29">我迷失了自我 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(自我)</span></text><text for="L30">无法好好应对心中的爱 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(是啊)</span></text><text for="L31">我会告诉你接下来该怎么做</text><text for="L32">对除我之外的他人 说下那句 我渴望你的陪伴</text><text for="L33">请你爱好好她</text><text for="L34">但是 请别评判我</text><text for="L35">我跟你想的不同 请别触碰我</text><text for="L36">我已无法顺心渡过余生</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Blind Curve"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Rainych"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Blind Curve - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1540623213"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:21.314" end="4:03.550"><p begin="0:21.314" end="0:28.410" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.314" end="0:21.474">ま</span><span begin="0:21.474" end="0:21.643">た</span><span begin="0:21.850" end="0:23.520">明日</span><span begin="0:23.520" end="0:23.731">の</span><span begin="0:24.018" end="0:24.767">夜</span><span begin="0:25.554" end="0:25.954">逢</span><span begin="0:25.954" end="0:26.122">い</span><span begin="0:26.122" end="0:26.522">た</span><span begin="0:26.522" end="0:26.762">い</span><span begin="0:27.186" end="0:27.614">な</span><span begin="0:27.615" end="0:28.043">ん</span><span begin="0:28.043" end="0:28.410">て</span></p><p begin="0:29.538" end="0:36.675" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.538" end="0:29.714">無</span><span begin="0:29.714" end="0:29.858">理</span><span begin="0:30.074" end="0:30.266">な</span><span begin="0:30.650" end="0:30.850">こ</span><span begin="0:31.178" end="0:31.395">と</span><span begin="0:31.723" end="0:31.915">ば</span><span begin="0:32.195" end="0:32.394">か</span><span begin="0:32.802" end="0:33.020">り</span><span begin="0:33.899" end="0:34.103">言</span><span begin="0:34.103" end="0:34.307">っ</span><span begin="0:34.308" end="0:34.794">て</span><span begin="0:34.794" end="0:34.99